# Route: guide 30 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1539 of 1546 eligible quests, 166.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 49 to
# 50, 32 quests, 2.9 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Darnassus, Teldrassil, Azshara, Badlands): near Craftsmen's Terrace ->
# Craftsmen's Terrace -> near Craftsmen's Terrace -> Craftsmen's Terrace ->
# near Craftsmen's Terrace -> Wellspring Lake -> Dolanaar -> Valormok ->
# Shadowsong Shrine -> Haldarr Encampment -> Shadowsong Shrine -> Legashi
# Encampment -> Thalassian Base Camp -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Prayer to Elune (3378; Twilight
# Dark Shaman 47-48, Twilight Fire Guard 48-49, Twilight Geomancer 49-50,
# Twilight Idolater 49-51); The Super Snapper FX (2944; Gammerita 48); Tremors
# of the Earth (717; Blacklash 50, Hematus 50).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 5141
# Dragonscale Leatherworking.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): In Search of Thaelrid (1198), Twilight Falls (1199), In
# Search of Thaelrid (1198), Twilight Falls (1199), Ribbly Screwspigot (4136),
# Kibler's Exotic Pets (4729), En-Ay-Es-Tee-Why (4862).

